  epo:definesReviewer <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/406653c2-b8ea-4210-88fa-7f8a054d62f8-01/Reviewer/ORG-0003> .

<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/406653c2-b8ea-4210-88fa-7f8a054d62f8-01/ReviewTerm$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot31_TenderingTerms1_AppealTerms1_PresentationPeriod1>
